```Title: Remote System Discovery via net or nltest (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1018 | Severity: low | Sigma id: e788846d-91a4-4a1c-98a3-1580575d0af0```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Administrators and IT inventory scripts```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity low.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
((Image IN ("*\\net.exe", "*\\net1.exe") CommandLine="* view*") OR (Image IN ("*\\net.exe", "*\\net1.exe") CommandLine="*group*" CommandLine="*domain computers*") OR (Image="*\\nltest.exe" CommandLine IN ("*/dclist*", "*/dsgetdc*")))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
